  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.8.0: Promotes SleepMemoryService (MapSleepMemory /api/sleep/*) and OS-sandboxed PeerBounceService (MapPeerBounce /api/bounce/* via Glacier.Agent.Sandbox) into Glacier.Serve; adds ReasoningBudgetPolicy multi-token <think> enforcement, OpenAI parity fields, runtime LoRA hot-loading/routing, Q4_0/Q8_0 quantized PagedAttention KV cache, and bandwidth-aware speculative decoding. Aligns Glacier.Inference v1.8.0, Glacier.Tune v1.4.0, Glacier.MemEx v1.2.0, and Glacier.Agent v1.5.0.",
